Backport of upstream TeaVM's points-to (dependency analysis) memory fixes to 9be5eca57, non-test parts only:
  55692a84a Fix typo in points-to analysis for monitorexit instruction
  9089fe100 core: deliver all source types when a transition merges domains
  00c0c9b6d Reduce memory consumption by pending types in transitions during points-to analysis (conflict in
            DependencyAnalyzer resolved to upstream's side: PendingTypes replaces hppc's IntHashSet)
  bbc601ccb Fix points-to analysis not merging certain nodes into domains when they are initially empty
  7c35d97ec Update ClassHierarchy logic to keep only set of class's ancestors instead of storing pair-wise relation
Why: at 9be5eca57 the analysis of mctick (Minecraft 26.2's server) did not finish in 8-12 GB.
Codegen: analysis only, but points-to results decide reachability and devirtualization, so a program's output can
differ (9089fe100 and bbc601ccb make the analysis more complete). wjharness/bench/jbox2d/build.sh's BUILD.txt
records the jbox2d module's hash so a change shows.

